y there so Democrats need a  progressive message and a few issues to  make their issues and rallying and  holding signs is great and it's fine if  it gets people involved but it's not  going to win elections right that's from  the voters point of  view and opposing Trump when he does  crazy things is all well and good for  House and Senate Democrats but you need  specific issues that will get people  active and I hope that Democrats will  take this seriously Pat yeah I think the  issue with going to anti Trump is that  what if the Trump Russia investigations  come back negative and there's no proof  of collusion sure what if his approval  ratings stay north of 40% and the stock  market continues to do well economy too  continues to do regular relatively well  you have to be able to have something  that you can go on the offensive with  not only that if the Trump Russia thing  implodes and Trump is actually impeached  now you don't even have Trump to run  against in 2018 or 2020 so I believe the  issues for progressives and ideally  Democrats should be there's overlap in  progressives and Democrats but it's not  a hundred percent as I'm sure you know  health care single most important issue  to Americans according to the most  recent Gallup most important problem  poll health care for all should be the  message now careful when I say that I  don't necessarily mean single-payer  government-run health care that's what I  would love that's maybe too specific and  a non-starter politically at this point  but health care for all as in something  for everyone some basic level of care  for everybody  100% coverage that is affordable and  that actually covers you okay number 2  save the planet  get away from global warming  specifically and even go beyond climate  change craft a message on the  environment that is not as much science  versus non science although that's  accurate right but we know that it  doesn't really convince people couch it  as patriotic and a moral duty